填空，声明两个变量a和b；以及两个指针pa和pb，分别指向a和b。通过指针pa改变a的值，在其上和通过指针pb访问的b的值相加：


```cpp_typein
int a = 12; int b = 13;
int * pa = &a;
int * pb = __0__b;
*pa += __1__pb; // 等价于 a += b;
```

resolved.question_text_html:
Type in a code to declare two variables, a and b; and two pointers, pa and pb, pointing to a and b, respectively. The value of a is changed via pointer pa, adding to it the value of b accessed via pointer pb.
[!raw!]
int a = 12; int b = 13;
int * pa = &a;
int * pb = {0}b;
*pa += {1}pb; // same as a += b;
